cardano-hw-go reimplements in Go the command line interface of
cardano-hw-cli by Vacuumlabs, and includes code ported from these projects:

- internal/tx is ported from cardano-hw-interop-lib by Vacuumlabs
  (https://github.com/vacuumlabs/cardano-hw-interop-lib), and internal/cli
  and internal/hw follow cardano-hw-cli by Vacuumlabs
  (https://github.com/vacuumlabs/cardano-hw-cli). Both are licensed under the
  ISC license:

